: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The system processes payments through secure, integrated links and streamlines the administrative journey from initial enquiry to final policy generation. It outputs accurate premium calculations and provides the broker with a centralized workflow to manage client policies and insurer relationships efficiently.</span></p>\n","clientName":"<p>A leading insurance broker in the UAE offering a full suite of car, travel, life, and general insurance policies.</p>\n","companyInfo":null,"keyBenefitsList":null,"projectCaseStudyFile":null,"technologyLogos":[{"altText":".Net Core","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/dot-net-logo.png"},{"altText":"Angular","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/angular-logo.png"},{"altText":"SQL Server","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/sql-server.webp"},{"altText":"Azure Hosting","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/azure-hoisting.webp"}],"testimonialAuthor":"Director","testimonialContent":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Building our portal with emQube has allowed us to scale our insurance brokerage significantly. The automation of our policy issuance and enquiry management has streamlined our entire back-office workflow.</span></p>\n"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"cG9zdDoxMTAw"}},"staticQueryHashes":["3649515864"],"slicesMap":{"footer":"footer","navigation-bar":"navigation-bar"}}